 "_superseded": "The driver waterfall's gap on the 16-agent registry corpus, kept because section 5b quotes it in a before/after comparison. Worst absolute gap 0.0047 and median 0.0012, against 0.0128 and 0.0054 on the 22-agent corpus. The gap scales with the posterior variance and sigma_agent went from 0.159 to 0.343 with the rebuild, so it grew with the width of the posterior rather than with any change to the decomposition -- which the sign test confirms: negative in 156 of 165 cells below rate 0.5, as Jensen's inequality requires. Superseded by artifacts/driver_waterfall.json."
